  worker: ailab
rules[4]: equal life in every game,no life bonuses,push with push_records.sh,no bonus tests
notes[1]: Add results for white and multicolour decks to missing research pool
# Main session's reading: a category is an archetype cell (tier, archetype A, archetype B): 18 inner cells with 5 games each = 90 games.
# White and multicolour decks are favoured in every draw (--focus W,multi) so the missing pool gets filled.
